<title>LATVIA: Volume climbs on Latvian bourse, Unibanka down.</title>
<headline>Volume climbs on Latvian bourse, Unibanka down.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volume climbed on Latvia's fledging bourse on Tuesday, the Riga stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Overall market volume was almost 75,000 lats compared with 58,500 lats at the last session on Thursday.</p>
<p>Market leader Unibanka accounted for the lion's share of the volume at 38,054 lats and its share price fell by 0.47 percent to 2.10 lats.</p>
<p>--Riga newsroom +3717-22 6 93</p>
